---

<section id="research" class="tile research-lead" style="--i:1">
  <span class="label">01 — Research</span>
  <h2>AI Research</h2>
  <p>
    Deep learning has achieved remarkable results, but current architectures are hitting fundamental limits.
    We believe the path forward lies in mathematics—specifically in understanding the geometric structure of data
    and the symmetries that govern learning.
  </p>
  <p>
    Fractal Manifold is a research lab focused on advancing deep learning through rigorous mathematical foundations.
    We work at the intersection of differential geometry, group theory, and neural network design to build models
    that are not just bigger, but fundamentally better.
  </p>
</section>

{features.map((feature, idx) => (
  <article class="tile area" style={`--i:${2 + idx}`}>
    <svg class="bg-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={feature.icon} />
    <h3>{feature.title}</h3>
    <p>{feature.text}</p>
  </article>
))}

<style>
  .research-lead {
    grid-row: span 2;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .area {
    min-height: 150px;
  }

  .research-lead p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1080px) {
    .research-lead {
      grid-column: span 6;
      grid-row: auto;
    }

    .area {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
  }
</style>
